// Golden Cross
//
// The 50/200-day crossover the financial press names. Slow enough that it trades a
// handful of times a decade, which is the point: it is a REGIME filter wearing a
// strategy's clothes, and its value is measured in drawdown avoided, not trades won.
//
// Expect very few out-of-sample trades on any normal window. That is honest evidence of
// nothing rather than evidence of failure — the scorecard says so explicitly.
strategy("Golden Cross", overlay = true)

fast = sma(close, 50)
slow = sma(close, 200)

plot(fast, title = "SMA 50", color = color.accent)
plot(slow, title = "SMA 200", color = color.mute)

if crossover(fast, slow)
    strategy.entry("golden", strategy.long)

if crossunder(fast, slow)
    strategy.close("golden")
